    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With donations dwindling the museum of natural history struggles to keep its doors open to the public. Working late one night trying to find where your former mentor disappeared to you receive a package, and with it a clue and a challenge. Prove yourself to your mysterious benefactor by researching the origin and era of ancient Waldwean artefacts and save the museum from ruin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through broad bodies of academic text to discern the origin of ancient Waldwean artifacts spanning six distinct eras. Identify the material make ups and cultural stories of the peoples of Waldwea to pinpoint the approximate culture and time the artefact would have made found in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve nine unique artifacts. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read through rich bodies of academia.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story through a fully voice acted protagonist.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With donations dwindling the museum of natural history struggles to keep its doors open to the public. Working late one night trying to find where your former mentor disappeared to you receive a package, and with it a clue and a challenge. Prove yourself to your mysterious benefactor by researching the origin and era of ancient Waldwean artefacts and save the museum from ruin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through broad bodies of academic text to discern the origin of ancient Waldwean artifacts spanning six distinct eras. Identify the material make ups and cultural stories of the peoples of Waldwea to pinpoint the approximate culture and time the artefact would have made found in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve nine unique artifacts. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read through rich bodies of academia.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story through a fully voice acted protagonist.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Take on the role of a struggling museum's curator who receives a mysterious challenge to identify artifacts from the ancient civilizations of Waldwea. Dive through a broad range of academic texts in order to identify the artifact's culture and the era it was produced in. Will you save the museum?",
